@startuml UML界面流转图
' 界面之间的跳转关系
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam shadowing false

title 界面流转图

state "登录 / 注册" as Login
state "账本列表" as List
state "空状态引导" as Empty
state "账本明细" as Detail
state "新增记录" as Create
state "校验提示" as Err
state "审核队列" as Review
state "统计分析" as Stat
state "预算与结算" as Settle
state "成员与权限" as Member
state "作废确认" as VoidConfirm
state "手机端明细" as Mobile

[*] --> Login
Login --> List : 登录成功
Login --> Login : 账号或密码错误
List --> Empty : 账号下无账本
Empty --> List : 新建或加入成功
List --> Detail : 进入某个账本
List --> Mobile : 窄屏自动切换
Detail --> Create : 新增
Detail --> VoidConfirm : 作废已审核记录
Detail --> Detail : 筛选 / 翻页
Create --> Err : 字段校验失败
Err --> Create : 按提示修改
Create --> Detail : 提交成功（待审核）
Detail --> Review : 有待审核时
Review --> Detail : 通过 / 驳回后返回
Detail --> Stat : 切到统计
Detail --> Settle : 切到预算与结算
Detail --> Member : 切到成员
Settle --> Settle : 结算 / 重开账期
Member --> Member : 邀请 / 改角色 / 移交

note right of Err
  三处同时报错：
  金额精度、日期越界、
  类别已停用。
end note

note bottom of VoidConfirm
  不可逆操作，
  必须复述对象 + 必填原因。
end note

@enduml
